Every idea must be tested.

Every experiment must have:

- Hypothesis
- Dataset
- Methodology
- Success criteria
- Failure criteria
- Evaluation approach
- Deliverables
- Lessons learned

Prefer experiments that:

- Produce measurable results
- Generate reusable assets
- Create repeatable benchmarks
- Answer strategic questions
- Produce visualisations
- Produce research findings

